Ek ghane jungle mein ek tota, ek kabutar aur ek chuha rehte the.
Tota upar ped par baithkar sabko khatre se chetavani deta tha.
Kabutar door-door tak udkar khane ka raasta dhoondhta tha.
Aur chuha zameen ke neeche se chhote raaste banata tha.
Ek din jungle mein aag lagne wali thi.
Tote ne chillakar sabko bataya, kabutar ne paani laane ka jugaad kiya,
aur chuhe ne sab jaanwaron ko surakshit raaste se bahar nikaal diya.
